'' PASCAL IS CALLEE-POP ON I686. Its parameter order is already reversed by the
'' ABI pass; the IR calling convention must be x86_stdcallcc as well, or ESP
'' drifts after every direct and pointer call.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win32 --emit-ir tests/codegen/src/pascal-callconv.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: define x86_stdcallcc i32 @"PASCALONLY"
'' EXPECT-OUT: call x86_stdcallcc i32 @"PASCALONLY"
'' EXPECT-OUT: call x86_stdcallcc i32 %
